                                                "sense_id": "b914b0b1-cd2e-3295-8244-6c7d7ff3c278",
                                                "text": "„Der hochnäsige Torperdermaat Burkert war wieder seekrank.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34d981bc-e177-42b9-ad3d-325a9a4b6c03",
